# D-DEMO deliverable, 2026-08-28. demo/DEMO.appname is 30 MB — more than TEN TIMES the
# largest tracked blob in this repository (2.8 MB) — so it is NOT committed; the operator
# decides whether it enters history. It is REBUILDABLE EXACTLY from demo/build-demo.jsonl +
# demo/hide-fills.jsonl + demo/demo-source.png through appname-cli, all of which ARE tracked.
# Declared here rather than left untracked because oint-fence.sh counts untracked paths as
# FOREIGN and is right to: `git add -A` can sweep them, which is the 492221fe mechanism.
# LEAVING IT UNDECLARED MAKES THE FENCE RED ON EVERY TICK, AND A GUARD THAT IS RED FOR BENIGN
# REASONS TRAINS ITS OPERATOR TO STOP READING IT (G-514).
demo/DEMO.appname
